    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli niyaambukha Yorodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa yahuuna mumabwibwi narula eShitimu niyoola enaYorodani, ye nabaana baIsiraeli bosi; nibakonelayo nibarashiaambukha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olunyuma lwetsindaalo tsitaru abasinjilili babira mukambi yosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibalachilisia abandu bari Olwa mulalola lisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe, nabakuhani abaLawi nibalichinjile, kho murule aha muli mulilondekhwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mumanye injila eya mukhoyile okhulonda; okhuba mushili okhulonda khunjila yino. Ne obwiyango bubeho hakari weenywe ninalio, obuchelwa shinga amakhono ebikhumila bibili; muralisitakhwo ahambi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoswa nasunjila abandu ari Mwiyahule abeene; okhuba mukamba OMWAMI alakhola akamangaliimwa hakari weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Yoswa naboolela abakuhani ari Chinje lisanduku lieindakano, mwambushe imbeli wabandu. Nibachinga lisanduku lieindakano nibeemila imbeli wabandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI naboolela Yoswa mbu Inyanga yino enjaka okhukhukhongoyia mumoni tsiaIsiraeli yosi, bamanye mbu shinga olwa ndalinji nende Musa, nolwa ndalabeetsanga ninawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe olache abakuhani abachinga lisanduku lieindakano ori Olwa mulaba nimuulile khundulo wamatsi kaYorodani, mwemeho muYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yoswa naboolela abaana baIsiraeli ari Mwitse muhulile amakhuwa kOMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa naboola mbu Khwikhuwa lino mulamanyilakhwo shinga Nyasaye oubeetsangaho mwoyo olwa ali hakari weenywe, khandi mbu shialakosa okhwilusia imbeli weenywe abaKanaani, nabaHiti, nabaHiwi, nabaPerizi, nabaGirigashi, nabaAmori, nabaYebusi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, lisanduku lieindakano yOMWAMI weshialo shiosi pe liambukha imbeli weenywe muYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bukule abandu ekhumi nababili okhurula mutsimbia tsialsiraeli, omundu mulala wabuli luyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa ebilenje biabakuhani abachinga lisanduku liOMWAMI, niye OMWAMI weshialo shiosi pe, biloola mumatsi kaYorodani, kho amatsi kaYorodani kalakhalikha; nako amatsi akarulanga emukulu kalasinjila shieshituuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa abandu barula mumaheema kabwe okhwambukha Yorodani, abakuhani abachinga lisanduku lieindakano nibaranjiliile abandu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi olwa abachinga lisanduku bali niboolile khuYorodani, ebilenje biabakuhani abachinga lisanduku nibiiyiniishe mumatsi khundulo wakwo (okhuba Yorodani kuyembanga khulukuku mundaalo tsiosi tsielichesa); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho amatsi akali nikarulanga emukulu nikeema, nikeebunjikha shieshituuli, ehale, eAdamu, litaala elo elirondokhana naZaretsani; nako akakholomokha katsie munyanza yaAraba, niyo inyanza yomuunyu, kali nikakhalishiile elala; abandu nabo nibaambushila ahahengana naYeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakuhani abachinga lisanduku lieindakano yOmwami basinjila nibaraliile khwiloba eliumu hakari muYorodani, Isiraeli bosi nibaambukha khwiloba eliumu, okhuula olwa lihanga liosi liali niliambuushe Yorodani pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
